WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.949
Palantir is known for helping

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.969
organisations harness data and AI

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.309
to make better decisions.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.549
For defence, that might mean

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.109
optimising the availability of your

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.389
people, ships, planes and tanks,

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.949
or being able to rapidly identify

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.869
targets and what to hit them with.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:24.889
We have worked with Western

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.349
militaries for almost 20 years.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.189
That includes over a decade in the

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.229
UK, which is also home

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.569
to more than one in six of our

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.669
employees, the highest proportion

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.469
among the world's biggest 20 tech

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.470
companies.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.449
And this is a thing that's perhaps

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.629
less well known about us.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.609
Our software offers a foundation for

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.729
the brightest defence tech

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.109
companies, like Hadean,

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.929
to build on top of and deploy

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.769
their software at scale,

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:51.770
faster.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.529
There are lots of challenges facing

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.949
disruptive technologies when

00:00:58.950 --> 00:00:59.809
deploying into classified

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.429
environments, from long procurement

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:03.309
cycles and meeting stringent

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:05.049
security requirements to gaining

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:06.909
access to data and building a

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.089
software infrastructure that meets

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:09.989
the MOD standards.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.629
This is why the MOD's commitment to

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.309
three month procurement cycles is so

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.949
important for defence startups in

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.129
the UK.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.409
It's partnerships like the one

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.809
between Hadian and Palantir that

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.249
make rapid commercial exploitation

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.250
actually possible.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.249
Hayden provides out-of-the-box

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:29.969
simulation and orchestration tools

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.929
that are used by armed forces to

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:34.029
rehearse, train, and plan

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.389
combat scenarios.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:37.729
Leveraging the potential of AI,

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.909
these tools rapidly generate

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.909
scenarios that represent both

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.149
virtual and live environments,

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.389
greatly increasing the speed and

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:46.269
efficiency across the entire

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.049
mission planning lifecycle.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.869
Hayden's Domini AI product is a

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.429
next generation command and control

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.429
system that accelerates planning

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.929
and decision making.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.709
Through fully integrated AI and

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.710
simulation.

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.109
It embeds diverse data sources into

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:02.029
a single, clear, and actionable

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.249
format to provide real-time

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.909
situational awareness, allowing

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.929
users to simulate forward and

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.229
determine the best course of action.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.279
Our AI needs to understand

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.899
military concepts the same way

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.439
operators do.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.699
Units, missions, rules of

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.839
engagement.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.359
Palantir is the bridge that lets our

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:26.099
simulation speak the same language

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.659
as our live operational systems.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.959
Building this ourselves would take

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.439
years and delay capability delivery.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.899
You need to integrate classified

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.359
intelligence feeds, logistics data,

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.619
sensor inputs, and historical

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.339
records, all with different security

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.189
classifications and formats.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.769
Panantis solves this problem out of

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.489
the box, which means we can focus on

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.169
building the best products rather

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.449
than focusing on data plumbing.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.199
This partnership with Palantir will

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.819
allow Haydn to turbocharge its

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.039
existing relationships with the MOD,

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.019
continuing to build on our

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:00.679
enterprise agreement and expand the

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.719
use of our suite of products.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.119
Haydian is currently providing its

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.539
cutting edge training software to

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.019
the armed forces, but with

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.819
Palanter's foundry underpinning the

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.239
products, Haydians software can

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:11.559
integrate seamlessly with the

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.499
existing MOD data fabric and deploy

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.529
faster into live environments.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.169
This partnership with Hadian is a

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.709
vital part of something broader for

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:19.770
Palantir in the UK.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.109
We struck an agreement with the

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.609
Ministry of Defence earlier this

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:25.629
year to make the UK our European

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.689
headquarters for defence.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.309
That agreement also formalised the

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.029
use of our software to help British

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.509
defence tech companies to bring

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:34.149
their technology into operational

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.169
use faster.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.989
And also to help them sell into the

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.849
US, the world's largest defence

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.349
market.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.449
The Ministry of defence has been

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.989
clear with us that this is what they

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.179
want us to do.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.759
And we are determined to deliver.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.159
It's an incredibly exciting mission

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:49.939
for us.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:51.179
It will help to support our armed

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.779
forces, it will help keep our

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.619
country safe, and it will drive

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.599
the success of a new generation of

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.960
British defence tech companies.

